* [`gl2.cartan`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Background/Ring-theory/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_gl2___cartan_FLQQ_--statement) — Cartan subgroup. Declarations (LeanBridge): `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.cartanSubgroup`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.extendedCartanSubgroup`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.relIndex_cartanSubgroup_extendedCartanSubgroup_eq_two`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.normalizer_cartanSubgroup_eq_extendedCartanSubgroup_iff`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.nonempty_algEquiv_prod_or_nonempty_algEquiv_nonsplitCartanAlgebraPow`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.nonempty_ringEquiv_nonsplitCartanAlgebraPow_of_unramifiedExtension`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.nonempty_ringEquiv_truncatedWittVector`, `Matrix.GeneralLinearGroup.existsUnique_nonempty_algEquiv_nonsplitAtAlgebra`. Note: Round AH (AH3\_cartan): the four blockers of round AG are closed; the general-ring and F\_p paragraphs were proved in round AG (CartanEtale.lean) and are not re-proved. (1) Z/p\^eZ, e \>= 1: nonempty\_algEquiv\_prod\_or\_nonempty\_algEquiv\_nonsplitCartanAlgebraPow, every free etale algebra A of rank 2 (with a basis) over ZMod (p\^e) is isomorphic to R x R or to the non-split algebra NonsplitCartanAlgebraPow p e = (Z/p\^e)\[w\], w\^2 = a + b w, a and b lifting the coefficients of round AG's NonsplitCartanAlgebra p = F\_\{p\^2\}; not\_nonempty\_algEquiv\_prod\_nonsplitCartanAlgebraPow, the two are not isomorphic (idempotents); both are free of rank 2 (Basis.finTwoProd, QuadraticAlgebra.basis) and etale (new instance for R x R via AlgEquiv.piFinTwo; the non-split one by Tau Ceti's QuadraticAlgebra.etale\_of\_isUnit\_discr, its discriminant b\^2 + 4a being a unit). Route: Algebra.FormallySmooth.nonempty\_algEquiv\_of\_surjective, a finite formally smooth A surjecting onto C is isomorphic to every M with at least as many elements surjecting onto C with kernel in t M, t nilpotent (Mathlib's FormallySmooth.liftOfSurjective, then M = phi(A) + t\^n M = phi(A), then cardinality); the reduction F\_p