s (visibleSwanSlopes), which define the formalised family. No category field (LeanBridge decls). Style fixes only, no statement changed. The user's ruling of 2026-11-13 (answering that question): the family's 'Swan slopes' are Deligne's positive upper breaks (visibleSwanSlopes), their agreement with the convex-hull slopes of lf.slopes being lf.slopes's own gap; so formalised with these decls.
