coefficients, since the coefficient field is only defined when one exists; that this implies the knowl's 'arithmetic' was claimed in the docstring without proof and is now proved (IsRational.isAlgebraic\_coeff: a\_n = (a\_n n\^\{w/2\}) / n\^\{w/2\}, a quotient of an algebraic integer by a square root of n\^w).
